## How do we calculate the regression line for 3000 kc PPD food supply?

::: columns
::: {.column width="40%"}
 

$$\begin{aligned}
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 53.24 + 0.025 \ \text{FLR} 
+ 0.186\ \text{FS}\\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 53.24 + 0.025 \ \text{FLR} 
+ 0.186\cdot 3000\\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 53.24 + 0.025 \ \text{FLR}
+ 557.861 \\
\widehat{\text{LE}} &= 611.102 + 0.025 \ \text{FLR}
\end{aligned}$$
